{"5135400":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Hunt The Ducks","steam_appid":5135400,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<strong>Every duck you shoot makes you stronger. Every upgrade turns the next round into a bigger storm of damage, feathers and cash.<\/strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135400\/extras\/16882dbbc9e58eeef3ffaf72e2c6e00b.poster.avif?t=1793638834\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135400\/extras\/16882dbbc9e58eeef3ffaf72e2c6e00b.webm?t=1793638834\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135400\/extras\/16882dbbc9e58eeef3ffaf72e2c6e00b.mp4?t=1793638834\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br>Hunt The Ducks is an incremental shooter built on short, frantic rounds. Fill your feather quota before time runs out, spend your earnings on the hunting map and come back stronger. A few rounds in, a single click sets off a chain reaction.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HUNTING MAP<\/h2>More than 60 upgrades branch out across a sprawling map. Boost raw damage and crits, unlock ricochet and bleed, build a money engine with tips and bigger payouts, or fill the sky with bigger flocks.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135400\/extras\/450ed50022a91f99717738e7b62beaa6.poster.avif?t=1793638834\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135400\/extras\/450ed50022a91f99717738e7b62beaa6.webm?t=1793638834\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135400\/extras\/450ed50022a91f99717738e7b62beaa6.mp4?t=1793638834\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ALL KINDS OF DUCKS<\/h2>The Drunk Duck that just can't fly straight, the Ghost Duck you can only hit while it's visible, the Electric Duck that sends lightning through the flock as it falls, the Golden Duck that starts a Gold Rush, and many more. Every level opens up a new corner of the sky and new ducks to meet.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135400\/extras\/c81c8aa276fe2bf02be5718ef1a1e012.poster.avif?t=1793638834\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135400\/extras\/c81c8aa276fe2bf02be5718ef1a1e012.webm?t=1793638834\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135400\/extras\/c81c8aa276fe2bf02be5718ef1a1e012.mp4?t=1793638834\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PERKS FOR YOUR PLAYSTYLE<\/h2>The perks you pick stay with you for the whole run and shape the way you play. Turn your gun into a machine gun, become a sharpshooter who clears the screen with a single bullet, or grow into a billionaire who makes every duck drop a pile of gold. Some perks grant huge power at a price, so every run turns into a different build.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135400\/extras\/fb646fdf6bdd8d9cea791aef9bffc865.poster.avif?t=1793638834\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135400\/extras\/fb646fdf6bdd8d9cea791aef9bffc865.webm?t=1793638834\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135400\/extras\/fb646fdf6bdd8d9cea791aef9bffc865.mp4?t=1793638834\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SPECIAL BULLETS<\/h2>Piercing, incendiary, explosive, shock and black hole bullets. Stack their chances and watch a single shot clear half the sky.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135400\/extras\/ed16c221f043503e68a3fa5cdf3bf26e.poster.avif?t=1793638834\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135400\/extras\/ed16c221f043503e68a3fa5cdf3bf26e.webm?t=1793638834\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135400\/extras\/ed16c221f043503e68a3fa5cdf3bf26e.mp4?t=1793638834\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMING IN THE FULL GAME<\/h2>Flocks of new ducks, special abilities, turrets, new chapters, bosses and a legacy system.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE DEMO<\/h2>The demo includes the first 5 levels, about 30–45 minutes of hunting. Add Hunt The Ducks to your wishlist to get notified at launch. And don't forget to join our Discord community to share your ideas and feedback!","about_the_game":"<strong>Every duck you shoot makes you stronger. Every upgrade turns the next round into a bigger storm of damage, feathers and cash.<\/strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135400\/extras\/16882dbbc9e58eeef3ffaf72e2c6e00b.poster.avif?t=1793638834\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135400\/extras\/16882dbbc9e58eeef3ffaf72e2c6e00b.webm?t=1793638834\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135400\/extras\/16882dbbc9e58eeef3ffaf72e2c6e00b.mp4?t=1793638834\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br>Hunt The Ducks is an incremental shooter built on short, frantic rounds. Fill your feather quota before time runs out, spend your earnings on the hunting map and come back stronger. A few rounds in, a single click sets off a chain reaction.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HUNTING MAP<\/h2>More than 60 upgrades branch out across a sprawling map. Boost raw damage and crits, unlock ricochet and bleed, build a money engine with tips and bigger payouts, or fill the sky with bigger flocks.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135400\/extras\/450ed50022a91f99717738e7b62beaa6.poster.avif?t=1793638834\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135400\/extras\/450ed50022a91f99717738e7b62beaa6.webm?t=1793638834\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135400\/extras\/450ed50022a91f99717738e7b62beaa6.mp4?t=1793638834\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ALL KINDS OF DUCKS<\/h2>The Drunk Duck that just can't fly straight, the Ghost Duck you can only hit while it's visible, the Electric Duck that sends lightning through the flock as it falls, the Golden Duck that starts a Gold Rush, and many more. Every level opens up a new corner of the sky and new ducks to meet.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135400\/extras\/c81c8aa276fe2bf02be5718ef1a1e012.poster.avif?t=1793638834\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135400\/extras\/c81c8aa276fe2bf02be5718ef1a1e012.webm?t=1793638834\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135400\/extras\/c81c8aa276fe2bf02be5718ef1a1e012.mp4?t=1793638834\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PERKS FOR YOUR PLAYSTYLE<\/h2>The perks you pick stay with you for the whole run and shape the way you play. Turn your gun into a machine gun, become a sharpshooter who clears the screen with a single bullet, or grow into a billionaire who makes every duck drop a pile of gold. Some perks grant huge power at a price, so every run turns into a different build.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135400\/extras\/fb646fdf6bdd8d9cea791aef9bffc865.poster.avif?t=1793638834\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135400\/extras\/fb646fdf6bdd8d9cea791aef9bffc865.webm?t=1793638834\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135400\/extras\/fb646fdf6bdd8d9cea791aef9bffc865.mp4?t=1793638834\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SPECIAL BULLETS<\/h2>Piercing, incendiary, explosive, shock and black hole bullets. Stack their chances and watch a single shot clear half the sky.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135400\/extras\/ed16c221f043503e68a3fa5cdf3bf26e.poster.avif?t=1793638834\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135400\/extras\/ed16c221f043503e68a3fa5cdf3bf26e.webm?t=1793638834\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135400\/extras\/ed16c221f043503e68a3fa5cdf3bf26e.mp4?t=1793638834\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMING IN THE FULL GAME<\/h2>Flocks of new ducks, special abilities, turrets, new chapters, bosses and a legacy system.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE DEMO<\/h2>The demo includes the first 5 levels, about 30–45 minutes of hunting. Add Hunt The Ducks to your wishlist to get notified at launch. And don't forget to join our Discord community to share your ideas and feedback!","short_description":"Shoot ducks, grab the cash, upgrade, repeat. Hunt The Ducks is a fast, addictive incremental shooter where you grow stronger every round: turn a calm sky into a storm of feathers and cash with crits, exploding ducks and chain reactions. Grow your hunting map step by step.","supported_languages":"English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Turkish","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135400\/fae2aa8ea8a38bbe066d6df915a63e90241cc474\/header.jpg?t=1793638834","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135400\/8c16209591ad2a9dc62eab00ecbcad33625008a4\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793638834","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135400\/8c16209591ad2a9dc62eab00ecbcad33625008a4\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793638834","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> 2.0 GHz Dual Core<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> 512 MB VRAM, DirectX 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 250 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Hypnos Games"],"publishers":["Hypnos Games"],"demos":[{"appid":5414490,"description":""}],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":499,"final":449,"discount_percent":10,"initial_formatted":"$4.99","final_formatted":"$4.49"},"packages":[1778574],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Hunt The Ducks","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1778574,"percent_savings_text":"-10% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Hunt The Ducks - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$4.99<\/span> $4.49","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":449}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"4","description":"Casual"},{"id":"23","description":"Indie"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135400\/a3d01d616e9f9859c2da3b7188aaff2ff0716017\/ss_a3d01d616e9f9859c2da3b7188aaff2ff0716017.600x338.jpg?t=1793638834","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135400\/a3d01d616e9f9859c2da3b7188aaff2ff0716017\/ss_a3d01d616e9f9859c2da3b7188aaff2ff0716017.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793638834"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135400\/8025f924b718f7f887032a5c282a50751eec0d4d\/ss_8025f924b718f7f887032a5c282a50751eec0d4d.600x338.jpg?t=1793638834","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135400\/8025f924b718f7f887032a5c282a50751eec0d4d\/ss_8025f924b718f7f887032a5c282a50751eec0d4d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793638834"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135400\/90a643ca20647ea56df3ca11796b8122a998543d\/ss_90a643ca20647ea56df3ca11796b8122a998543d.600x338.